title: The voice switch is visible
pid: 9dc0e659-c157-4ff3-99d1-37230ca0a7d6
body: |2-
  Every reply begins its headline with an author marker:
  "[Claude]" or "[Jeff]", meaning "Claude says" or "Jeff says".
  Jeff often abbreviates his to '[j]' or '[js]; Claude, who "types
  faster", needn't. More title text after the marker is
  optional, e.g. '[Claude]: yes for data, and I'd stop there'.
  Headings beneath a marked heading are by the same author until another
  marker starts a reply, so the marker need not be repeated.
